{"root":"pentung","ipa":"/pənˈtuŋ/","core":"用粗重坚硬的东西击打、棒击。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/pənˈtuŋ/","zh":"击打，棒击","phrases":[{"t":"pentung kepala","zh":"击打头部"},{"t":"dipentung kayu","zh":"被木棍击打"},{"t":"alat pementung","zh":"击打工具"}],"examples":[{"t":"Pencuri itu dipentung oleh warga.","zh":"那个小偷被居民们殴打。"},{"t":"Dia membawa pentung untuk berjaga-jaga.","zh":"他带着一根棍子以防万一。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"pentung","ipa":"/pənˈtuŋ/","zh":"击打，木棍","phrase":{"t":"bawa pentung","zh":"带着棍棒"},"example":{"t":"Polisi membawa pentung karet.","zh":"警察携带了橡胶警棍。"}},{"w":"mementung","ipa":"/məˈmən.tuŋ/","zh":"用棍棒击打","phrase":{"t":"mementung anjing","zh":"用棍子打狗"},"example":{"t":"Ayah mementung ular itu sampai mati.","zh":"父亲用棍子把那条蛇打死了。"}},{"w":"dipentung","ipa":"/diˈpən.tuŋ/","zh":"被击打，被棒击","phrase":{"t":"dipentung pencuri","zh":"被小偷袭击"},"example":{"t":"Anjing itu dipentung karena mencuri makanan.","zh":"那只狗因为偷吃东西而被棍子打。"}},{"w":"pementung","ipa":"/pəˈmən.tuŋ/","zh":"棍棒，击打者","phrase":{"t":"pementung besi","zh":"铁制棍棒"},"example":{"t":"Pementung itu tergantung di dinding.","zh":"那根棍子挂在墙上。"}}],"derSlugs":["pentung","mementung","dipentung","pementung"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T17:16:16.304Z","src":"base"}